  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 902.04 Contained YRC campus",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 902.04 “Contained YRC campus” means a parcel of land, with or without buildings thereon, that is:\n\n(a) Used for youth recreation camping;\n\n(b) Not open for use by the general public while the YRC is in operation; and\n\n(c) Typically, but not necessarily, in a rural location.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 900) #12364, eff 9-1-17",
